iend-zoning, imprisonment, emotional manipulation, and much more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766830/extras/084ffcd9dec663199bd313c8feb0c266.avif?t=1752752943\" width=616 height=231 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3 Mushrooms. 22 Endings.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your mushroom's mental health and affection carefully. All characters have their own personalities and unique struggles - including you! Make your story as horrific or as heart-warming as you desire!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766830/extras/4801ff55a41ddfc7c56706db2adb0677.avif?t=1752752943\" width=88 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game is not suitable for children or those who are easily disturbed. Please check the content warnings.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
